[{"client_msg_id":"9423e69b-3e0d-4a3c-b66e-8101d6ccb55b","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"とはいえ最後に行ったの2か月前か。","ts":"1628589909.440200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TE/Jo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"af0e9fde-a143-4f12-b1cf-be1a275cf0cb","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"利久は比較的良く行ってるかもしれない。","ts":"1628589877.439900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U5OzZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ae688c90-8ea6-4aa7-af99-10987e0495ff","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ハナマサでタン、一本見たことあるけど、まぁいつもあるわけではないだろうな。","ts":"1628589835.439300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eR6Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0e36c920-e529-45bd-983b-26fcfe673314","type":"message","user":"UEACRCY0Z","text":"仙台で食べたたんや善次郎は美味しかったなあ","ts":"1628589494.438500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cJ8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aca9ad4b-32b7-458a-9edc-2ad80e292782","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"店舗によるでしょうが、業務スーパーなら牛タンが1本で売ってた記憶があります。","ts":"1628589290.438000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sFN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e8b95cf0-eeae-4a1f-b862-2c87f59b17da","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"最後に行ったのいつだったか…","ts":"1628589067.437200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I2DVn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"324e90c0-0267-4a6b-978a-4cfb23ae0107","type":"message","user":"UEACRCY0Z","text":"「たん清」行きたい！","ts":"1628588994.437000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XV8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb095477-3ea9-43f9-8b53-2b0a8c978154","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"秋葉原の「たん清」(焼肉屋)はある意味聖地。","ts":"1628586917.436500","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1628586929.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LShh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"94d04f49-9cad-41ad-9b18-aa343b237868","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"関東でも焼肉の牛タンくらいしかないですよ。本場は宮城、仙台かなぁ?","ts":"1628586888.436200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aav3x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"36DA2489-290D-4D4E-820C-9D71000506EB","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"関西出身なので、牛タン店の知見がないんですよね。ねぎしくらいしか行ったことないのです。","ts":"1628586656.435600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QPla0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"90ba7d6f-e58d-46b7-8662-b948277db647","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"たん清は一人は無理なんだよなぁ…","ts":"1628586530.434100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MRK6A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5699c624-3bd4-4aad-8905-4022ec56747f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"厚切りの牛タン、食べたいな。","ts":"1628586504.433500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mqIZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4D10A610-583D-4BA6-A3BE-8BBE07053CA1","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"今日は牛タンです","ts":"1628586397.433100","files":[{"id":"F02AHGNHJES","created":1628586390,"timestamp":1628586390,"name":"Image from iOS.jpg","title":"Image from iOS","mimetype":"image/jpeg","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"jpg","pretty_type":"JPEG","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":480661,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02AHGNHJES/image_from_ios.jpg","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02AHGNHJES/download/image_from_ios.jpg","original_h":3024,"origi